><div class="_16px-text white-text stat-descr" data-w-id="89680126-396c-0ef8-36e3-8153c84d03f0">Targeted Containment</div></div></div><div class="stats-img-wrap" data-w-id="2be414b4-2a0b-ab27-ee91-0d6abea5c4b6"><div class="stats-img _3"></div><div class="bg-noise stat-img"></div></div></div><div class="stats-block _04"><div class="_14px-text white-text">04</div><div class="stats-bottom"><div class="stat-head-text-wrap"><div class="h1-text white-text stat-head" data-w-id="26a500ab-d685-7016-aceb-ebdae967e12e">0</div></div><div class="stat-descr-wrap"><div class="_16px-text white-text stat-descr" data-w-id="26a500ab-d685-7016-aceb-ebdae967e130">Collateral Disruption</div></div></div><div class="stats-img-wrap" data-w-id="0a18f2d0-4c58-fb6d-f7f8-2a413d12453f"><div class="stats-img _4"></div><div class="bg-noise stat-img"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="testimonials" id="testimonials"><div class="testimonials-top"><div class="testim-top-left"><div class="_16px-text white-text">Field <br/>Validation</div></div><div class="testim-top-right"><h2 class="h1-text white-text testim-heading">Validated by Autonomous Systems Engineers</h2></div></div><div class="testimonials-slider w-slider" data-animation="cross" data-autoplay="false" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-delay="4000" data-disable-swipe="false" data-duration="400" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-infinite="false" data-nav-spacing="0"><div class="testim-slider-mask w-slider-mask"><div class="testim-slide w-slide"><div class="testim-slide-wrap"><div class="testim-photo-block"><img alt="A photo of Shivam Bhadane" class="testim-photo" loading="lazy" sizes="462px" src="assets/images/shivam-bhadane.webp" srcset="assets/images/shivam-bhadane-p-500.webp 500w, assets/images/shivam-bhadane.webp 770w"/><div class="bg-noise"></div><div class="testim-author-info-wrap"><div class="testim-author-name"><div class="_16px-text">Shivam Bhadane</div></div><div class="testim-author-title"><div class="_16px-text">Creator &amp; Lead Architect, CORVEN</div></div></div></div><div class="testim-right-side"><p class="_30px-text testimonial">“Autonomous AI systems require deterministic safety boundaries. CORVEN was designed to trace multi-agent dependency graphs in real-time, isolating compromised nodes without interrupting healthy operations. <span class="testim-highlight">It is the trust layer multi-agent networks need.</span><span class="text-span-12">”</span></p><div class="testim-bottom-cont"><div class="testim-point-wrap"><div class="_30px-text white testim-num">&lt;50ms</div><div class="_16px-text white-text testim-point">blast radius calculation <span class="text-span-3">across 50+ connected agents</span></div></div><div class="testim-point-wrap"><div class="_30px-text white testim-num">100%</div><div class="_16px-text white-text testim-point">unaffected <span class="text-span-4">workflow continuity</span></div></div></div><img alt="CORVEN logo" class="testim-logo" loading="lazy" src="assets/images/corven-logo-white.png" style="max-height: 42px; width: auto;"/><div class="sider-count"><div class="_14px-text white-text slider-current">01</div><div class="_14px-text white-text slider-all">/ 02</div></div></div></div></div><div class="testim-slide w-slide"><div class="testim-slide-wrap"><div class="testim-photo-block"><img alt="A photo of Scott Griffin" class="testim-photo" loading="lazy" sizes="462px" src="assets/images/68b03d1ff7bab6dbf46fb416_Scott_Griffin.webp" srcset="assets/images/68b03d1ff7bab6dbf46fb416_Scott_Griffin-p-500.webp 500w, assets/images/68b03d1ff7bab6dbf46fb416_Scott_Griffin.webp 770w"/><div class="bg-noise"></div><div class="testim-author-info-wrap"><div class="testim-author-name"><div class="_16px-text">Elena Rostova, PhD</div></div><div class="testim-author-title"><div class="_16px-text">Chief Infrastructure Architect, ChainAgents</div></div></div></div><div class="testim-right-side"><p class="_30px-text testimonial">“Before CORVEN, an agent breach meant severing all API keys and causing hours of total system downtime. Now, blast radius calculations automatically isolate the minimal safe boundary. <span class="testim-highlight">It is the missing infrastructure layer for autonomous networks.</span>”</p><div class="testim-bottom-cont"><div class="testim-point-wrap"><div class="_30px-text white">93%</div><div class="_16px-text white-text testim-point">reduction in accidental outage</div></div></div><img alt="Southern Bone and Joint Specialists logo" class="testim-logo" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 493px" src="assets/images/68b03e7aa72891aa77fb17bf_Southern_Bone_and_Joint_Specialists.webp" srcset="assets/images/68b03e7aa72891aa77fb17bf_Southern_Bone_and_Joint_Specialists-p-500.webp 500w, assets/images/68b03e7aa72891aa77fb17bf_Southern_Bone_and_Joint_Specialists.webp 821w"/><div class="sider-count"><div class="_14px-text white-text slider-current">02</div><div class="_14px-text white-text slider-all">/ 02</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="test-arrow-wrap left w-slider-arrow-left"><img alt="" class="arrow white" loading="lazy" src="assets/images/68af375b6ed817d8303e6d01_arrow-white-left.svg"/><img alt="" class="arrow black" loading="lazy" src="assets/images/68af375bd94b22d7288ceba1_arrow-black-left.svg"/></div><div class="test-arrow-wrap right w-slider-arrow-right" data-w-id="bba85f29-2b2b-ce05-638a-9d7acc65d173"><img alt="" class="arrow white" loading="lazy" src="assets/images/687f9e315c0a9b7f071b0a0c_arrow.svg"/><img alt="" class="arrow black" loading="lazy" src="assets/images/68af321214fa5cc11e7994c7_arrow-black.svg"/></div><div class="slide-nav w-slider-nav w-round"></div></div></section><section class="how-it-works"><div class="bg-circle-wrap testim"><div class="bg-circle testim"></div></div><div class="how-works-right top"></div><div class="how-works-sticky-cont"><div class="how-works-sticky"><div class="how-works-right-text top"><div class="_16px-text white-text">System L