"pixel green mob-hide"></div><div class="pixel blue mob-hide"></div><div class="pixel green mob-hide"></div><div class="pixel blue mob-hide"></div><div class="pixel green mob-hide"></div><div class="pixel blue mob-hide"></div><div class="pixel green mob-hide"></div></div></div><div class="right-side-w-line"></div><div class="bg-noise"></div></div><div class="stacking-cards-section schudule-agent" id="products"><div class="horizontal-wrap scheduling"><div class="left-side our-products"><div class="_16px-text">Core Architecture</div></div><div class="right-side agent schedule"><h2 class="h1-text agent sch">Agent &amp; Dependency Registry</h2><div class="_16px-text num-agent-1">#1</div></div></div><div class="sheduling-top-space"><div class="left-side empty-white"></div></div><div class="scheduling-cards"><div class="scheduling-card _1"><div class="_30px-text white stack-card-left">01</div><div class="stack-card-text-wrap"><div class="_30px-text white stack-card-head" style="max-width: 45ch;">Agent &amp; Topology Discovery</div><div class="_14px-text white-text stack-card-text" style="max-width: 55ch; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">Continuously discovers and catalogs autonomous agents, wallets, smart contracts, MCP tools, APIs, and databases into a unified dependency graph.</div></div><div class="bg-noise cards"></div></div><div class="scheduling-card _2"><div class="_30px-text white stack-card-left">02</div><div class="stack-card-text-wrap"><div class="_30px-text white stack-card-head _2" style="max-width: 45ch;">Transitive Dependency Mapping</div><div class="_14px-text white-text stack-card-text _2" style="max-width: 55ch; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">Traces multi-hop authority delegation, cross-agent message paths, and shared credential chains to eliminate hidden operational blind spots.</div></div><div class="bg-noise cards"></div></div><div class="scheduling-card _3"><div class="_30px-text white stack-card-left">03</div><div class="stack-card-text-wrap"><div class="_30px-text white stack-card-head" style="max-width: 45ch;">Dynamic Permission Synchronization</div><div class="_14px-text white-text stack-card-text _3" style="max-width: 55ch; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">Tracks ephemeral session tokens, delegated allowances, and access controls in real time across decentralized networks and cloud infrastructure.</div></div><div class="bg-noise cards"></div></div><div class="scheduling-card _4"><div class="_30px-text white stack-card-left">04</div><div class="stack-card-text-wrap"><div class="_30px-text white stack-card-head" style="max-width: 45ch;">Topological Graph Engine</div><div class="_14px-text white-text stack-card-text _4" style="max-width: 55ch; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">Maintains an ultra-low latency graph structure enabling millisecond reachability queries and real-time dependency audits.</div></div><div class="bg-noise cards"></div></div></div></div><div class="half-split-wrap"><div class="half-split-section"><div class="tabs w-tabs" data-current="Tab 1" data-duration-in="300" data-duration-out="300" data-easing="ease-out" id="pairTabs"><div class="tabs-menu w-tab-menu" ms-code-rotate-tabs="4000"><a class="tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current" data-w-tab="Tab 1"><div class="_30px-text black">Lateral Movement Modeling</div><div class="_14px-text white-text task-text-row">Simulates and determines all downstream agents, credentials, and resources reachable from an infected node.</div><div class="tab-progress-vert"></div></a><a class="tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link" data-w-tab="Tab 2"><div class="_30px-text black">Cascading Risk Assessment</div><div class="_14px-text white-text task-text-row">Scores operational, data, and financial impact across interconnected systems before taking enforcement action.</div><div class="tab-progress-vert"></div></a><a class="tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link" data-w-tab="Tab 3"><div class="_30px-text black">Minimum Safe Boundary Calculation</div><div class="_14px-text white-text task-text-row">Calculates the smallest necessary containment boundary to halt threat spread while keeping unaffected workflows live.</div><div class="tab-progress-vert"></div></a></div><div class="tabs-content w-tab-content"><div class="tab-pane w-tab-pane w--tab-active" data-w-tab="Tab 1"><div class="tab-pane-wrap"><div class="task-img-wrap"></div><div class="_14px-text white-text task-text">Simulates and determines all downstream agents, credentials, and resources reachable from an infected node.</div><div class="bg-noise task-agent"></div></div></div><div class="tab-pane w-tab-pane" data-w-tab="Tab 2"><div class="tab-pane-wrap"><div class="task-img-wrap"></div><div class="_14px-text white-text task-text">Scores operational, data, and financial impact across interconnected systems before taking enforcement action.</div><div class="bg-noise task-agent"></div></div></div><div class="tab-pane w-tab-pane" data-w-tab="Tab 3"><div class="tab-pane-wrap"><div class="task-img-wrap"></div><div class="_14px-text white-text task-text">Calculates the smallest necessary containment boundary to halt threat spread while keeping unaffected workflows live.</div><div class="bg-noise task-agent"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="half-head-text-wrap task-agent"><h2 class="h1-text agent task">Blast Radius Engine</h2><div class="_16px-text">#2</div></div></div></div><div class="row-tabs-section"><div class="horizontal-wrap navigator"><div class="left-side with-line"></div><div class="right-side agent navigator"><h2 class="h1-text agent">Containment<br/>Gateway</h2><div class="_16px-text">#3</div></div></div><div class="row-tabs w-tabs" data-current="Tab 1" data-duration-in="0" data-duration-out="0" data-easing="ease"><div class="row-tabs-menu w-tab-menu"><a class="row-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current" data-w-tab="Tab 1" ms-code-onhover="click"><div class="_30px-text row-tab-head">Session &amp; Token Revocation</div><div class="_16px-text row-tab-text">Instantly revokes delegated credentials, session keys, and smart contract allowances at the protocol level.</div></a><a class="row-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link" data-w-tab="Tab 2" ms-code-onhover="click"><div class="_30px-text row-tab-head">Tool Call &amp; RPC Filtering</div><div class="_16px-text row-tab-text">Intercepts and drops malicious tool execution requests and inter-agent RPCs at the authorization gateway.</div></a><a class="row-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link" data-w-tab="Tab 3" ms-code-onhover="click"><div class="_30px-text row-tab-head">Autonomous Quarantine Sandboxing</div><div class="_16px-text row-tab-text">Isolates compromised agents into monitored zero-authority environments for live forensic inspection.</div></a><a class="row-tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link" data-w-tab="Tab 4" ms-code-onhover="click"><div class="_30px-text row-tab-head">Precision Non-Disruptive Enforcement</div><div class="_16px-text row-tab-text">Guarantees uninfected peer agents and business workflows continue executing without collateral interruption.</div></a></div><div class="row-tabs-content w-tab-content"><div class="row-tab-pane w-tab-pane w--tab-active" data-w-tab="Tab 1"><div class="row-tab-pane-wrap"><div class="nav-agent-img-wrap"></div></div></div><div class="row-tab-pane w-tab-pane" data-w-tab="Tab 2"><div class="row-tab-pane-wrap"><div class="nav-agent-img-wrap"></div></div></div><div class="row-tab-pane w-tab-pane" data-w-tab="Tab 3"><div class="row-tab-pane-wrap"><div class="nav-agent-img-wrap"></div></div></div><div class="row-tab-pane w-tab-pane" data-w-tab="Tab 4"><div class="row-tab-pane-wrap"><div class="nav-agent-img-wrap"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="split-cards-section"><div class="split-cards-left-wrap"><div class="half-head-text-wrap out-agent"><h2 class="h1-text agent">Evidence<br/>Service</h2><div class="_16px-text">#4</div></div><div class="_16px-text out-left-bottom">Cryptographic Auditability &amp; Forensics</div></div><div class="split-cards-right-wrap"><div class="out-card _1"><div class="out-card-top-wrap"><div class="_30px-text white">Tamper-Proof Incident Logs</div><div class="_16px-text white-text blue-card">01</div></div><div class="_16px-text white-text out-card-text-bottom">Records complete sequence histories of breach indicators, analysis, and containment actions in append-only logs.</div></div><div class="out-card _2"><div class="out-card-top-wrap"><div class="_30px-text white">Cryptographic Containment Proofs</div><div class="_16px-text white-text blue-card">02</div></div><div class="_16px-text white-text out-card-text-bottom">Generates verifiable cryptographic proofs that compromised operations were blocked within designated boundaries.</div></div><div class="out-card _3"><div class="out-card-top-wrap"><div class="_30px-text white">On-Chain Notarization</div><div class="_16px-text white-text blue-card">03</div></div><div class="_16px-text white-text out-card-text-bottom">Anchors incident fingerprints and evidence digests to Ethereum and decentralized registries for non-repudiation.</div></div><div class="out-card _4"><div class="out-card-top-wrap"><div class="_30px-text white">Automated Forensic Reports</div><div class="_16px-text white-text blue-card">04</div></div><div class="_16px-text white-text out-card-text-bottom">Produces comprehensive post-mortem analytics and compliance documentation immediately following an incident.</div></div><div class="out-card _5"><div class="out-card-top-wrap"><div class="_30px-text white">Policy Verification Auditing</div><div class="_16px-text white-text blue-card">05</div></div><div class="_16px-text white-text out-card-text-bottom">Continuously validates that deployed containment rules match organizational governance and security policies.</div></div><div class="out-card space"></div></div></div></section><div class="transition-cont white-to-black"><div class="transition-wrap black"><div class="grid-row _5 _w-b